While the announcement of Dolly's existence and the publication of the landmark *Nature* paper occurred in February 1997, Dolly was actually born the year before, on July 5, 1996. The Roslin Institute delayed the public announcement until the scientific paper was ready for publication and patents were secured. The proposed answer falsely claims that her actual birth took place in February 1997.

